	measure 'Weely Host' = ```
			
			var pre = "Meeting Host: "
			var curHost = 
			CALCULATE(
			    MAX('Meeting host'[Host]), 
			    FILTER('Meeting host',
			        'Meeting host'[IsCurrentWeekHost]="T"
			        )
			    )
			
			RETURN
			    pre &curHost
			```
		lineageTag: 4850288b-61cf-4967-b5d8-ec98bee9e8e2

		changedProperty = Name

